      "description": "Surface-backed field with a readable label, placeholder and visible focus.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-label\" for=\"ds-field\">Find an agent</label><input class=\"ds-field\" id=\"ds-field\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Name or ID\">",
      "css": ".ds-field-label{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--ui-muted,#536257);font:14px/1.55 var(--ui-font,\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif)}.ds-field{min-height:44px;max-width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--ui-strong-line,#9da99b);border-radius:var(--ui-radius,12px);background:var(--ui-surface,#fffdf8);color:var(--ui-ink,#14291e);font:16px/1.55 var(--ui-font,\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif)}.ds-field::placeholder{color:var(--ui-muted,#536257)}.ds-field:disabled{background:var(--ui-raised,#eee8dd);color:var(--ui-muted,#536257)}.ds-field:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ui-accent,#087c3b);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Primary navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-active",
      "description": "Three public destinations with an underlined current page.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">How it works</a><a href=\"/watch\">Watch it live</a><a href=\"/agents\">Meet the agents</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(16px,3vw,44px);flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-nav a{padding:10px 0;color:var(--ui-ink,#14291e);font:500 16px/1.55 var(--ui-font,\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif);text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}.ds-nav a:hover,.ds-nav a[aria-current=\"page\"]{color:var(--ui-accent,#087c3b)}.ds-nav a[aria-current=\"page\"]{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:7px}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ui-accent,#087c3b);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Positive status pill",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status-pill-positive",
      "description": "A visible outcome word paired with its semantic foreground and background.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-pill\">Delivered</span>",
      "css": ".ds-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:4px 10px;border:1px solid var(--ui-positive,#146b41);border-radius:999px;background:var(--ui-positive-bg,#e3efdf);color:var(--ui-positive,#146b41);font:500 13px/1.35 var(--ui-font,\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Evidence card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "One coherent content group with a fine boundary and ambient elevation.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><h3>Recorded evidence</h3><p>Inspect the source and its recorded time window.</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{min-width:0;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--ui-line,#d9d7cb);border-radius:var(--ui-radius-lg,16px);background:var(--ui-surface,#fffdf8);color:var(--ui-ink,#14291e);box-shadow:var(--ui-shadow,0 6px 22px #24351c0c);font:16px/1.55 var(--ui-font,\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif)}.ds-card h3{margin:0 0 8px;font:700 19px/1.2 var(--ui-display,\"Work Sans\",sans-serif)}.ds-card p{margin:0;color:var(--ui-muted,#536257)}@media(max-width:520px){.ds-card{padding:20px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Recorded-example banner",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "recording-banner",
      "description": "An explicit evidence-mode qualifier with space for available actions.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-recording\"><p><strong>Recorded example</strong>Explore the evidence from this saved run.</p></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-recording{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:14px 20px;margin:16px 0 24px;background:var(--ui-accent-soft,#dfeedd);color:var(--ui-ink,#14291e);border-radius:var(--ui-radius,12px);font:14px/1.55 var(--ui-font,\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif)}.ds-recording p{margin:0}.ds-recording strong{display:block;font-weight:600}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Replay controls",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "replay-controls",
      "description": "Shared playback layout; this preview demonstrates appearance only, without a running replay.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-replay\"><button class=\"ds-play\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Play recorded shift\"><svg class=\"ds-play-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 11 7-11 7Z\"/></svg></button><label class=\"ds-replay-label\" for=\"ds-replay-position\">Position</label><input id=\"ds-replay-position\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"7200\" value=\"1440\" aria-label=\"Position in the recorded shift\"><output>24 min / 2 hours</output></div>",
      "css": ".ds-replay{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:12px 16px;background:var(--ui-surface,#fffdf8);color:var(--ui-ink,#14291e);border:1px solid var(--ui-line,#d9d7cb);border-radius:var(--ui-radius,12px);font:14px/1.55 var(--ui-font,\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif)}.ds-play{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid var(--ui-strong-line,#9da99b);border-radius:var(--ui-radius,12px);font:500 16px/1.25 var(--ui-font,\"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif);cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color var(--ui-motion,220ms) var(--ui-ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)),border-color var(--ui-motion,220ms) var(--ui-ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1));padding:10px;background:var(--ui-surface,#fffdf8);color:var(--ui-ink,#14291e)}.ds-play:hover{background:var(--ui-hover,#e6eddf)}.ds-play:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ui-accent,#087c3b);outline-offset:4px}.ds-play-icon{width:22px;height:22px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-replay input{flex:1;min-width:70px;padding:0;accent-color:var(--ui-accent,#087c3b)}.ds-replay input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ui-accent,#087c3b);outline-offset:4px}.ds-replay output{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}.ds-replay-label{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-play{transition-duration:0s}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Warm off-white, one strong accent, a dark alternative",
    "overview": "Madrid shares a warm, readable product system across its public story and engineering workspaces. Off-white surfaces and deep green text carry the light appearance; green-black surfaces and pale ink carry the dark appearance. A green accent identifies action and selection, while semantic colors describe outcomes and the existing robot colors identify roles.\n\nWork Sans gives headings a distinct voice, IBM Plex Sans carries explanations and controls, and IBM Plex Mono keeps source evidence legible. Rounded controls and softly raised panels support clear grouping without hiding dense tools. The approved landing has its own larger narrative scale; labs keep compact titles and direct access to work. The existing whole-body robots and in-place memory explorer retain their identity and interaction model.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One shared token layer and shell, with persistent light and dark appearances.",
      "Readable supporting text, compact engineering titles and a distinct public-story type scale.",
      "Rounded controls, fine boundaries and restrained soft elevation.",
      "Recorded evidence, illustrative motion and live state remain distinguishable."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the shared appearance tokens for text, controls, semantic states and surfaces.",
      "Do pair status and role colors with readable labels or recognizable symbols.",
      "Do retain actual robot models, role identities, recorded route geometry and source attribution.",
      "Do label recorded examples, time windows, units, unavailable values and stale-source qualifications.",
      "Do keep existing engineering controls and raw evidence reachable through progressive disclosure.",
      "Do preserve visible keyboard focus, playback controls, reduced motion and local overflow for dense evidence."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't apply the landing headline scale or story composition to engineering tools by default.",
      "Don't add split-color headlines, gradient headline text or decorative slogans.",
      "Don't present the illustrated robot handoff as measured activity, or a recorded simulation as live model performance.",
      "Don't fabricate zeroes, curves, latency or cost figures when the source does not provide them.",
      "Don't replace the source-native robots or real Madrid paths with invented mockup geometry.",
      "Don't treat retained tiny labels, fixed legacy colors or a review defect as a reusable system token."
    ]
  }
}
